1
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:21,090
Oh, please don't let me die

2
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:26,760
Waiting for your touch

3
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,990
No, don't give up on life

4
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,850
This endless dead end

5
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:36,570


6
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:40,690
狂った時計　刻む命

7
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:44,490
こぼれてく記憶の砂

8
00:00:44,490 --> 00:00:48,380
芽生えた想いまで

9
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:55,210
ねえ　こんなに呆気なく

10
00:00:55,210 --> 00:01:00,690
消えてしまうの

11
00:01:00,690 --> 00:01:01,900
I wish I was there

12
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:04,100
Oh, please don't let me die

13
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:06,190
Waiting for your touch

14
00:01:06,190 --> 00:01:10,470
二度となにも失くさぬように

15
00:01:10,470 --> 00:01:17,410
私を忘れて　始めて “Restart”

16
00:01:17,410 --> 00:01:19,660
No, don't give up on life

17
00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:21,550
This endless dead end

18
00:01:21,550 --> 00:01:26,250
君を砕くこの悲しみが

19
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:31,430
いつか終わりますように

20
00:01:31,430 --> 00:01:36,080
For now I'll see you off

21
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:39,660
My time is spinning around

22
00:01:39,660 --> 00:01:43,540
Your deep black eyes

23
00:01:43,540 --> 00:01:47,430
I forgot what time it is

24
00:01:47,430 --> 00:01:52,810
And our memories are gone…？

25
00:01:52,810 --> 00:01:56,900
甘い香り放つ

26
00:01:56,900 --> 00:02:00,610
追憶という名の罠

27
00:02:00,610 --> 00:02:04,490
誘われ囚われ

28
00:02:04,490 --> 00:02:11,350
なぜ抗えもせず　また

29
00:02:11,350 --> 00:02:16,680
溺れてしまうの

30
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,860
I wish you were here

31
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:20,150
Oh, never close your eyes

32
00:02:20,150 --> 00:02:22,230
Searching for a true fate

33
00:02:22,230 --> 00:02:26,740
どこか消えたあのぬくもりを

34
00:02:26,740 --> 00:02:33,410
追いかけ続けて　見失う “Restart”

35
00:02:33,410 --> 00:02:35,670
So, let us try again

36
00:02:35,670 --> 00:02:37,940
From the very first time

37
00:02:37,940 --> 00:02:42,300
“きっときっと” そうやって今も

38
00:02:42,300 --> 00:02:47,690
虚しい輪を描いてる

39
00:02:47,690 --> 00:02:51,690
For now, see you again

40
00:02:51,690 --> 00:03:19,180
…fading in, fading out…

41
00:03:19,180 --> 00:03:20,460
I wish we were there

42
00:03:20,460 --> 00:03:24,680
あの日々には戻れない

43
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:29,180
時は強く　哀しく強く

44
00:03:29,180 --> 00:03:36,000
ただただ進んでゆくだけ “Restart”

45
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,240
No, don't give up on life

46
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:40,070
This endless dead end

47
00:03:40,070 --> 00:03:44,840
振り返らない　そんな強さを

48
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:50,050
誰も皆演じている

49
00:03:50,050 --> 00:03:55,700
For now I'll see you off

50
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:57,080
And we'll die

51
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:59,330
Waiting for a new day

52
00:03:59,330 --> 00:04:01,560
二度と…

53
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:03,490


54
00:04:03,490 --> 00:04:05,010
And we'll start

55
00:04:05,010 --> 00:04:07,260
Waiting for a new day

56
00:04:07,260 --> 00:04:09,000
君と…

57
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:15,150
Oh, please don't let me die

58
00:04:15,150 --> 00:04:17,150
消えないで ah…
